[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19081.27, "timestamp": "05:18:01", "text": "使其在 Windows 系统中实现，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19083.99, "timestamp": "05:18:03", "text": "对，你可以拥有这片风景。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19087.43, "timestamp": "05:18:07", "text": "剪了点什么的，对吧？”所以我照做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19090.23, "timestamp": "05:18:10", "text": "因为那时候我没法旋转我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19092.31, "timestamp": "05:18:12", "text": "监视器。所以我就想，“好吧，我要走了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19096.15, "timestamp": "05:18:16", "text": "以某种方式翻转景观"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19100.39, "timestamp": "05:18:20", "text": "那个东西。”然后，嗯，键盘"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19103.35, "timestamp": "05:18:23", "text": "现在我得把它翻过来。真是太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19105.83, "timestamp": "05:18:25", "text": "很难，对吧？我以前常常把椅子翻过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19109.35, "timestamp": "05:18:29", "text": "也。所以我不得不站着什么的。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19111.67, "timestamp": "05:18:31", "text": "天哪，那真是太混乱了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19114.07, "timestamp": "05:18:34", "text": "停止这样做了。我心情不好。我想念"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19118.55, "timestamp": "05:18:38", "text": "就是那种旋转的东西。哇。你给了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19125.99, "timestamp": "05:18:45", "text": "但问题是，这是另一个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19127.99, "timestamp": "05:18:47", "text": "这也是我喜欢Twitch的原因之一。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19131.51, "timestamp": "05:18:51", "text": "因为互动太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19133.67, "timestamp": "05:18:53", "text": "这可以通过聊天窗口完成。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19136.55, "timestamp": "05:18:56", "text": "从闲聊中就能听到类似“呃”的声音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19138.31, "timestamp": "05:18:58", "text": "警报是有的，但除此之外……"}]